  - single_codepoint_graphemes (default true): Every character in your running data is a single codepoint (no decomposed accents, ZWJ emoji, or flag sequences). About running data, not source.
Tag a rule with `assumptions: [<existing switch name>]` ONLY to rescue a
rare-text-divergent (same-type) rewrite. You MUST NOT invent a switch in the
